WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.474
Today your child taps every sound in a word, and writes only the first one.

2
00:00:04.924 --> 00:00:07.504
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:08.004 --> 00:00:13.611
Say the name of the picture. Sun. Then say it slowly, and touch one box for each sound.

4
00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:22.604
The word is sun.

5
00:00:23.504 --> 00:00:26.964
That is the whole move. Say it, tap it, write it, read it back.

6
00:00:27.414 --> 00:00:31.967
One word on the page has only two sounds. Two sounds, two boxes.

7
00:00:35.145 --> 00:00:37.386
Do the three pictures in job one together.

8
00:00:37.836 --> 00:00:45.876
Then name the six pictures in job two with your child, so every picture has the right word. Their names are printed small at the bottom.

9
00:00:46.326 --> 00:00:52.706
Your child does job two alone. Tapping matters more than the letter today, so ask them to tap out loud.

10
00:00:53.156 --> 00:00:58.171
At the end, your child taps and says the sounds of three pictures for you. Mark each one.
